        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Big Data\n- Groups: Underworld\n- People: Alan Wilkis, Karl Hyde, Rick Smith\n- Songs: “Dangerous”\n- Releases: 1.0, 2.0\n- Places: Cardiff\n\nFacts:\n- In 1980, Underworld was formed in Cardiff as a British electronic group.\n- Underworld is the principal name under which Karl Hyde and Rick Smith have recorded together.\n- In 2013, “Dangerous” by Big Data appeared on the debut EP 1.0.\n- Big Data is an American electronic music project created by producer Alan Wilkis.\n- In 2015, “Dangerous” by Big Data also appeared on the debut studio album 2.0.",
